        "snippet": "Senseonics (SENS) Q1 2026 Earnings Transcript | The Motley Fool\n\nAccessibility Menu\n\nMost Active Stocks Daily Stock Gainers Daily Stock Losers\n\nMost Active Stocks Daily Stock Gainers Daily Stock Losers\n\nBy Motley Fool Transcribing– May 9, 2026 at 2:32PM EST\n\nImage source: The Motley Fool.\n\nThursday, May 7, 2026 at 4:30 p.m. ET\n\n## CALL PARTICIPANTS\n\n- President & Chief Executive Officer — Tim Goodnow\n- Chief Operating Officer — Brian Hansen\n- Chief Financial Officer — Frederick Sullivan\n- Chief Medical Officer — Francine Kaufman\n- Chief Operating Officer, International — Mukul Jain\n\n## TAKEAWAYS\n\n- Revenue -- $11.7 million, reflecting 85% year-over-year growth from $6.3 million, driven by continued momentum in Eversense 365 new patient additions and higher adoption in profitable channels.\n- Gross Margin -- 58%, attributed to more new users, higher manufacturing volumes, and the elimination of the Ascensia revenue share; excluding a onetime $0.5 million benefit, gross margin would have ",
